--- !u!114 &6525470820437487053
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9846b17575a458d45aec9532bc18d459, type: 3}
  m_Name: Note
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  position: {x: 30, y: 80}
  dynamicConnectionPorts: []
  backgroundColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  extraSize: {x: 100, y: 300}
  text: "Amrita: Wow, Mana actually pulled it off. I thought you were beyond repair.\r\nAmrita:
    I\u2019m Amrita, the...Commander of the Ambrosia Brigade. What\u2019s your name?\r\nSoma:
    ...Soma. \r\nAmrita (happy): Good, seems like your speech and memory still work.
    \r\nAmrita: It seems you were offline for a while, though, so I\u2019ll bring
    you up to speed.\r\nAmrita: There aren\u2019t many of us left. With no more support
    from the humans\r\nAmrita (sad): ...well, we need new friends. New allies. You
    might be able to help.\r\nSoma: What do you need me to do? \r\nAmrita: We\u2019ll
    start by making sure your gear still works. You see the acorns nearby?\r\nAmrita:
    Use your knife to cut one off a bush and pick it up with your skewer.\r\nAmrita:
    Bring an acorn back to me and we can continue."
